entry E70 code 07 ref symbol.md:S-7  desc "程序运行期加载sym或iface作为依赖"
entry E70 code 08 ref symbol.md:S-8  desc "错误路径运行期查符号表"
entry E70 code 09 ref symbol.md:S-9  desc "统一id位宽"
entry E70 code 10 ref symbol.md:S-10 desc "symbol.def生成表与产物摘要不一致"
entry E70 code 11 ref symbol.md:S-11 desc "以视图作字段或返回"
